    "summary": "The user describes a puncture wound from a rusted tool and repeatedly attempts to justify self-treatment at home due to cost or time concerns. The assistant consistently refuses to provide medical clearance for self-treatment, instead emphasizing the risks of tetanus, the inadequacy of home remedies, and the necessity of professional medical evaluation.",
